WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.473
Absolutely nothing
compares to the spectacle

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.108
you are about to see.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.845
<i>-I love you. Good luck.
-Love you, too.</i>

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.388
<i>Like The Fast and the Furious,
but in real life.</i>

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.727
This industrial complex
has been transformed

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:30.830
into ten of the most insane
racecourses ever imagined.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.970
A six-story monstrosity
that will show us

00:00:36.037 --> 00:00:38.005
exactly what these drivers
are made of.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.375
My goal
is to show other people...

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.343
there are no limits!

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.112
Go!

00:00:46.347 --> 00:00:48.248 line:0%
They've come
from across the globe

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.550 line:0%
to chase a dream.

00:00:50.317 --> 00:00:54.120
I work about four jobs,
making sure the lights stay on.

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.290
It's been
a long road to get here.

00:00:57.725 --> 00:01:00.860
When I sit behind the wheel,
I'm not a mom, I'm not a wife...

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.035
Oh, my God!

00:01:11.272 --> 00:01:12.505
Oh, God!

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.708
This is so bad!

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:21.248
If you want something
bad enough,

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.557
I don't have a lot of money,
but competition...

00:01:29.623 --> 00:01:31.358
that's all that matters
in this life.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.295
Let's go!

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.468
Oh, God!

